      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of radiation dermatitis following fluoroscopy is described. Radiation dermatitis occurs rarely after fluoroscopic procedures and may pose a diagnostic challenge. Many patients do not consider fluoroscopy to be a source of radiation exposure, and clinicians may be confused by its unusual presentation."},
